<title>UK: UK April non-EU trade deficit 335 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK April non-EU trade deficit 335 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data:</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    April    March   April 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance			 -335     -651     -704</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			 6,636    5,714    6,013</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			 6,971    6,365    6,717</p>
<p>    Oil exports			     242	191	277</p>
<p>    Oil imports			     410	281	400</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending April   -1,467    n/a    -2,396</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 600 million stg deficit.  </p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 156.6    141.2    141.5</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 149.3    135.7    132.1</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   0.5%   -0.5%</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps)   4.0%    3.0%</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   4.0%    5.0%</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps)   9.0%   10.0%</p>
<p>TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Balance (million stg)		    -259    -407	-665</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)  -0.5%   -2.5%</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   3.5%    2.0%</p>
</text>
